{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.parseBlocks\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseBlocks</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">indent</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> := <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw\">Block.Raw</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Identifies the complete block structure of `s`. Up to `indent` leading spaces of each line are\nskipped.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.parseBlocks","kind":"def","line":944,"name":"Lean.Markdown.parseBlocks","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Block.lean#L944-L949"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.buildRefTable\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">buildRefTable</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">blocks</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw\">Block.Raw</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">externalRefs</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Data/HashMap/Basic.html#Std.HashMap\">Std.HashMap</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.ExternalRef\">ExternalRef</a></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Core.html#EmptyCollection.emptyCollection\">∅</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.RefTable\">RefTable</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Builds the document's reference table from its link reference definitions and from `externalRefs`,\nwhich maps labels to definitions that the caller supplies.\n\nAn earlier definition of a label in the document takes precedence over a later one. A definition in\nthe document takes precedence over an external one with the same label unless the external one has\n`overrideDocument` set.\n\nThe labels of `externalRefs` are normalized like those in the document. When several of them\nnormalize to the same label, the definition of the lexicographically least of them is used.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.buildRefTable","kind":"def","line":915,"name":"Lean.Markdown.buildRefTable","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Block.lean#L915-L942"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Array.QSort.Basic","Init.Data.Range.Polymorphic.Iterators","Init.Data.Range.Polymorphic.Nat","Init.Data.String.Compare","Init.Data.String.Iterate","Init.While","Lean.Data.Markdown.Block","Lean.Data.Markdown.InlineCursor","Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.BlockZipper","Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.Cursor","Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.Html","Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.RefDef"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.Block"}